error[E0810]: a temporary has no home — bind it first
 --> mem:///main.lu:8:20
  |
8 |     let s = render(Dot { x: 7 } as dyn Draw)
  |                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this value would not outlive the cast
  |
  = note: the dyn pair's data half points AT the operand, so the operand must be a place: a
    binding, a field, or an index. Bind it first — `let home = …` — and cast the binding:
    `home as dyn Draw`.
